{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":47,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by the sons of Korah."},{"n":1,"text":"Oh clap your hands, all you nations. Shout to God with the voice of triumph!","tok":[{"t":"Oh clap "},{"t":"your","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" hands, all you nations. Shout "},{"t":"to","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" God "},{"t":"with","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" voice "},{"t":"of","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" triumph!"}]},{"n":2,"text":"For the LORD Most High is awesome. He is a great King over all the earth.","tok":[{"t":"For","s":["H3605"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3605"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" Most High "},{"t":"is","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" awesome. "},{"t":"He","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"is","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" great King "},{"t":"over","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"all","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" earth."}]},{"n":3,"text":"He subdues nations under us, and peoples under our feet.","tok":[{"t":"He","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" subdues nations "},{"t":"under","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"us","s":["H5921"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"and","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" peoples "},{"t":"under","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"our","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" feet."}]},{"n":4,"text":"He chooses our inheritance for us, the glory of Jacob whom he loved. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"He","s":["H7272"]},{"t":" chooses "},{"t":"our","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" inheritance "},{"t":"for","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"us","s":["H8478"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"the","s":["H8478"]},{"t":" glory "},{"t":"of","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" Jacob "},{"t":"whom","s":["H5971"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"he","s":["H7272"]},{"t":" loved. Selah."}]},{"n":5,"text":"God has gone up with a shout, the LORD with the sound of a trumpet.","tok":[{"t":"God "},{"t":"has","s":["H5159"]},{"t":" gone up "},{"t":"with","s":["H5159"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" shout, "},{"t":"the","s":["H3290"]},{"t":" 